    "body": "ODS imports stop at the first text child. A string cell containing `before ` followed by `<text:span>after</text:span>` imports as `before `; later paragraphs are also dropped. This affects headers and data cells.\n\nI have a fix and regression tests ready. The full suite passes locally on Python 3.11 (194 passed, 1 skipped). Would you be willing to fund the fix for US$25?\n\nDima Mak / ub3dqy",
