    "body": "Dataset.filter() rebuilds the same requested-tag set for every row, even though the selection hasn't changed.\n\nFor example, filtering 10,000 contacts using 100 audience tags rebuilds that same set 10,000 times.\n\nCould we build it once and reuse it? Small inputs could keep the original approach, since the extra checks also take time.\n\nThis should only improve performance. Row order, duplicate-tag handling, metadata, generators and existing errors should stay the same.\n",
