    "body": "`Dataset.subset()` becomes slow on larger datasets because it repeatedly looks up the same column positions for every row. It also searches a list each time it checks whether a row was selected.\n\nThese repeated searches are unnecessary. We can calculate the column positions once and store the selected row numbers in a set for faster lookup.\n\nThis reduces the time complexity from approximately O(n³) to O(n²) while keeping the existing behavior unchanged.",
